14
00:00:31.553 --> 00:00:34.560
You're so incredible in this show.

15
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:38.090
And Melanie, I also believe you will be nominated

16
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:40.007
for an Emmy for this show.

17
00:00:40.007 --> 00:00:41.673
(audience applauds)
No. I-

18
00:00:41.673 --> 00:00:46.673
And then I also just had the esteemed pleasure

19
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:50.491
as we all did, watching you win your award

20
00:00:50.491 --> 00:00:53.840
at the Critics Choice, and then you get up there

21
00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.460
and you kind of do this thing that goes viral

22
00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:02.220
